The system prompt templates carry a further lineage: opencode's own templates
were derived from Anthropic's Claude Code, and phrasing from it survives in
src/prompt/templates/*.txt. The templates here are substantially rewritten —
instructions pointing at tools this project does not have were removed rather
than commented out — but the debt is real and is recorded here rather than
left implicit.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Character width data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The East Asian Wide / Fullwidth code point ranges in src/cli/width.ts and
src/tool/background.ts are derived from Markus Kuhn's public-domain wcwidth.c
implementation (https://www.cl.cam.ac.uk/~mgk25/ucs/wcwidth.c) and from the
Unicode Character Database file EastAsianWidth.txt.

